{"3901850":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Desktop Duck","steam_appid":3901850,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5354610],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/13fd5798a8a8026cc33b6a92dace61ac.poster.avif?t=1793286020\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/13fd5798a8a8026cc33b6a92dace61ac.webm?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/13fd5798a8a8026cc33b6a92dace61ac.mp4?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet your new desktop companion<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Duck is a lightweight virtual pet that lives right on your screen. It doesn't sit in a window waiting for you. It wanders your desktop, hops onto your windows, naps on the taskbar, and notices what you're up to.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It has a life of its own<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reacts to you.<\/strong> Type and it gets busy with you. Go quiet and it finds its own fun.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keeps itself busy.<\/strong> It reads a book, plays with a virtual pet, bounces a ball, juggles a soccer ball, or just sneezes.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Has feelings about its toys.<\/strong> Take one away and you'll hear about it.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loves attention.<\/strong> Pet it, pick it up, toss it across the screen, and set it down wherever you want its home to be.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/249b1508e22efb611a25b647db72c138.poster.avif?t=1793286020\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/249b1508e22efb611a25b647db72c138.webm?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/249b1508e22efb611a25b647db72c138.mp4?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dress it up<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duck brings you gifts as you spend time together. Unwrap hats and glasses, fill out your Collection, and turn duplicates into Feathers to spend on the pieces you're after. Every item is a real Steam item you can trade with friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/153a38826a83bcb33b014e255b01e27d.poster.avif?t=1793286020\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/153a38826a83bcb33b014e255b01e27d.webm?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/153a38826a83bcb33b014e255b01e27d.mp4?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A companion that also helps you focus<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus Mode.<\/strong> Start a session and your duck settles down and keeps you company quietly until you're done.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Website Blocking.<\/strong> Tell your duck which sites to keep you off, and it will fly over and close the tab for you.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Screen time stats.<\/strong> See where your day went, without the guilt trip.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/16810195bcd1b7a104e60307e1c8ba46.poster.avif?t=1793286020\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/16810195bcd1b7a104e60307e1c8ba46.webm?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/16810195bcd1b7a104e60307e1c8ba46.mp4?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring your friends' ducks over<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join friends online and their ducks show up on your desktop beside yours. Chat, send emotes, and watch them waddle around together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/dabc44051a187a28a750d57a4926b9df.poster.avif?t=1793286020\" width=1000 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/dabc44051a187a28a750d57a4926b9df.webm?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/dabc44051a187a28a750d57a4926b9df.mp4?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made to stay out of your way<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Duck is light on your PC and never covers your full-screen games. Your activity stays on your computer, and all you need is Steam.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/13fd5798a8a8026cc33b6a92dace61ac.poster.avif?t=1793286020\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/13fd5798a8a8026cc33b6a92dace61ac.webm?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/13fd5798a8a8026cc33b6a92dace61ac.mp4?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet your new desktop companion<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Duck is a lightweight virtual pet that lives right on your screen. It doesn't sit in a window waiting for you. It wanders your desktop, hops onto your windows, naps on the taskbar, and notices what you're up to.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It has a life of its own<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reacts to you.<\/strong> Type and it gets busy with you. Go quiet and it finds its own fun.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keeps itself busy.<\/strong> It reads a book, plays with a virtual pet, bounces a ball, juggles a soccer ball, or just sneezes.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Has feelings about its toys.<\/strong> Take one away and you'll hear about it.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loves attention.<\/strong> Pet it, pick it up, toss it across the screen, and set it down wherever you want its home to be.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/249b1508e22efb611a25b647db72c138.poster.avif?t=1793286020\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/249b1508e22efb611a25b647db72c138.webm?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/249b1508e22efb611a25b647db72c138.mp4?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dress it up<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duck brings you gifts as you spend time together. Unwrap hats and glasses, fill out your Collection, and turn duplicates into Feathers to spend on the pieces you're after. Every item is a real Steam item you can trade with friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/153a38826a83bcb33b014e255b01e27d.poster.avif?t=1793286020\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/153a38826a83bcb33b014e255b01e27d.webm?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/153a38826a83bcb33b014e255b01e27d.mp4?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A companion that also helps you focus<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus Mode.<\/strong> Start a session and your duck settles down and keeps you company quietly until you're done.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Website Blocking.<\/strong> Tell your duck which sites to keep you off, and it will fly over and close the tab for you.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Screen time stats.<\/strong> See where your day went, without the guilt trip.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/16810195bcd1b7a104e60307e1c8ba46.poster.avif?t=1793286020\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/16810195bcd1b7a104e60307e1c8ba46.webm?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/16810195bcd1b7a104e60307e1c8ba46.mp4?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring your friends' ducks over<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join friends online and their ducks show up on your desktop beside yours. Chat, send emotes, and watch them waddle around together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/dabc44051a187a28a750d57a4926b9df.poster.avif?t=1793286020\" width=1000 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/dabc44051a187a28a750d57a4926b9df.webm?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/extras\/dabc44051a187a28a750d57a4926b9df.mp4?t=1793286020\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made to stay out of your way<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Duck is light on your PC and never covers your full-screen games. Your activity stays on your computer, and all you need is Steam.<\/p>","short_description":"Your desktop deserves a duck. It lives on your screen, perches on your windows, and reacts to you. Earn hats together, then trade, sell, or show them off.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Dutch, Greek, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Portugal","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/4cf06512ce8b8ac7b9133f9038dc7b54b835e987\/header.jpg?t=1793286020","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/855f2e26145639c7fe84f427e6b5ff2f03923458\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793286020","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3901850\/855f2e26145639c7fe84f427e6b5ff2f03923458\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793286020","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit, version 2004 (build 19041) or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong>  1 GHz 64-bit dual-core (x64)<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any DirectX 11 capable GPU, including integrated<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Any modern quad-core x64<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any dedicated or modern integrated GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[]}}}